---
const procs = ['nvim', 'claude', 'cargo test', 'npm run dev', 'bash'];
---

<section class="section sessions" id="sessions" aria-labelledby="sessions-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Client and server</p>
      <h2 class="h2" id="sessions-title">Close the window. <em>Keep the work.</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">
        A background server owns every shell. The window you look at is only a client that draws frames, so closing it, or
        clicking <span class="kb">quit</span>, changes nothing for your programs. Run <code>cornercase</code> again and you are back.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="diagram reveal" aria-labelledby="diagram-caption">
      <div class="clients">
        <div class="client one">
          <div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>your terminal</span></div>
          <div class="body">
            <span class="state on">attached</span>
            <span class="state off">detached · shells still running</span>
            <span class="l w70"></span><span class="l w40"></span><span class="l w55"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="client two">
          <div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>another terminal</span></div>
          <div class="body">
            <span class="state on">attached · mirrored</span>
            <span class="l w55"></span><span class="l w70"></span><span class="l w30"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <svg class="wires up" viewBox="0 0 1000 90" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path class="wire one" d="M270 0 C270 50 500 40 500 90"></path>
        <path class="wire" d="M730 0 C730 50 500 40 500 90"></path>
      </svg>
      <div class="server">
        <div class="server-title">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 4 4" aria-hidden="true" shape-rendering="crispEdges"><path d="M1 0h3v1H1zM0 1h1v3H0z"></path></svg>
          cornercase server
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>projects, workspaces, tabs</li>
          <li>one PTY per pane</li>
          <li>libghostty-vt emulators</li>
          <li>session.json</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="socket">unix socket · frames out, events in</span>
      </div>
      <svg class="wires down" viewBox="0 0 1000 90" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        {[100, 300, 500, 700, 900].map((x) => <path class="wire" d={`M500 0 C500 45 ${x} 45 ${x} 90`} />)}
      </svg>
      <ul class="procs">
        {procs.map((p) => <li><i></i>{p}</li>)}
      </ul>
      <figcaption id="diagram-caption" class="sr-only">
        Two terminals attach to one cornercase server over a Unix socket. The server owns the projects, one PTY per pane and their
        emulators, and runs nvim, claude, cargo test, npm run dev and bash. When a terminal detaches, the programs keep running.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="points">
      <div class="point reveal">
        <h3><span>01</span> Detach, don't kill</h3>
        <p>Closing the terminal or clicking <span class="kb">quit</span> detaches. Agents keep working, tests keep running, servers keep serving.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="point reveal">
        <h3><span>02</span> Mirror any terminal</h3>
        <p>Attach from several terminals at once and they mirror each other, at the size of the one you are using.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="point reveal">
        <h3><span>03</span> Your layout comes back</h3>
        <p>A fresh server reopens your last session: projects, workspaces, tabs and splits, each pane with a new shell in its folder.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .head {
    max-width: 860px;
  }

  .kb {
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--red);
    color: #07060b;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .diagram {
    position: relative;
    margin: clamp(44px, 6vw, 80px) auto 0;
    max-width: 1000px;
    padding: clamp(18px, 3vw, 36px);
    border-radius: 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(60% 50% at 50% 50%, rgb(135 95 255 / 0.12), transparent 75%),
      var(--bg-2);
  }

  .clients {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 8%;
    padding-inline: 8%;
  }

  .client {
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    background: var(--term);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .client.one {
    animation: detach 9s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes detach {
    0%,
    35%,
    85%,
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
      filter: none;
    }
    45%,
    75% {
      opacity: 0.35;
      filter: grayscale(1);
    }
  }

  .bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    height: 26px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .bar i {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #2b2839;
  }

  .bar span {
    margin-left: 8px;
  }

  .body {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 12px 12px 14px;
  }

  .state {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .one .state {
    grid-area: 1 / 1;
  }

  .one .state.on {
    animation: show 9s infinite;
  }

  .one .state.off {
    color: var(--yellow);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: hide 9s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes show {
    0%,
    38%,
    82%,
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    42%,
    78% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  @keyframes hide {
    0%,
    38%,
    82%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    42%,
    78% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  .l {
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08);
  }

  .w30 {
    width: 30%;
  }
  .w40 {
    width: 40%;
  }
  .w55 {
    width: 55%;
  }
  .w70 {
    width: 70%;
  }

  .wires {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(44px, 7vw, 76px);
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .wire {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--purple);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-dasharray: 6 8;
    vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
    animation: flow 1.4s linear infinite;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .down .wire {
    stroke: var(--cyan);
    opacity: 0.55;
    animation-duration: 2s;
  }

  .up .wire.one {
    animation:
      flow 1.4s linear infinite,
      cut 9s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes flow {
    to {
      stroke-dashoffset: -28;
    }
  }

  @keyframes cut {
    0%,
    38%,
    82%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
    42%,
    78% {
      opacity: 0.08;
    }
  }

  .server {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 560px;
    padding: 18px 22px 20px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(135 95 255 / 0.55);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(135 95 255 / 0.14), rgb(135 95 255 / 0.04)), var(--panel);
    box-shadow: 0 0 60px -20px rgb(135 95 255 / 0.6);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .server-title {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .server-title svg {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    fill: var(--purple);
  }

  .server ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 7px;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .server li {
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.05);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .socket {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: -11px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 2px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border: 1px solid rgb(135 95 255 / 0.45);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--purple-3);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .procs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .procs li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 9px 6px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    background: var(--term);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .procs i {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--green);
    animation: alive 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .procs li:nth-child(2) i {
    animation-delay: 0.3s;
  }
  .procs li:nth-child(3) i {
    animation-delay: 0.6s;
  }
  .procs li:nth-child(4) i {
    animation-delay: 0.9s;
  }
  .procs li:nth-child(5) i {
    animation-delay: 1.2s;
  }

  @keyframes alive {
    50% {
      opacity: 0.3;
    }
  }

  .points {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(20px, 3vw, 40px);
    margin-top: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px);
  }

  .point h3 {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .point h3 span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--cyan);
  }

  .point p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 15.5px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .clients {
      padding-inline: 0;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .procs {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }

    .procs li:nth-child(n + 4) {
      display: none;
    }

    .down path:nth-child(1),
    .down path:nth-child(5) {
      display: none;
    }

    .points {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .socket {
      font-size: 10px;
    }
  }
</style>
